---
import FixPromptPreview from './previews/FixPromptPreview.astro';
import { PRODUCT_NAME } from '../../config';
---
<section class="s wrap rule fs" id="unblock" data-name="Fix prompt" aria-labelledby="u-h">
  <div class="feat">
    <div class="copy">
      <h2 id="u-h">A fix prompt for stuck work, <span class="soft">in two keystrokes.</span></h2>
      <p>When a PR conflicts or fails CI, {PRODUCT_NAME} says why in plain words. It also writes the prompt for you: which files, which PR on main touched them, which check failed and the last lines of its log. Copy it and paste it to whichever agent you use, or fix it yourself.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Templates for conflicts and CI failures, per repo</li>
        <li>Or post it as a PR comment, for agents that watch their PRs</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <FixPromptPreview />
  </div>
</section>
